msgid "What this tutorial covers {#what-this-tutorial-covers}"
msgstr "Ano ang sakop ng tutorial na ito {#what-this-tutorial-covers}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial is structured in two parts:\n"
msgstr "Ang tutorial na ito ay nakaayos sa dalawang bahagi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Steps 1–3 (small-scale examples):** Introduce the QRMI API with a simple Bell state circuit demonstration on IBM Quantum hardware, covering direct low-level primitive usage as well as high-level `QRMIService` and `SamplerV2` integration.\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 1–3 (maliliit na halimbawa):** Ipinakikilala ang QRMI API gamit ang isang simpleng demonstrasyon ng Bell state circuit sa IBM Quantum hardware, na sumasaklaw sa direktang paggamit ng low-level primitive gayundin sa high-level integrasyon ng `QRMIService` at `SamplerV2`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Large-scale hardware example:** A complete SQD workflow for the N$_2$ molecule at a bond distance of 1.0 $\\AA$ (cc-pVDZ basis active space, 26 spatial orbitals / 52 qubits), executed on IBM Quantum hardware through QRMI. SQD combines quantum sampling of a LUCJ ansatz constructed with `ffsim` and self-consistent configuration recovery with `qiskit-addon-sqd`.\n"
msgstr "**Malaking halimbawa sa hardware:** Isang kumpletong SQD workflow para sa molekulang N$_2$ sa bond distance na 1.0 $\\AA$ (cc-pVDZ basis active space, 26 spatial orbitals / 52 qubits), isinagawa sa IBM Quantum hardware sa pamamagitan ng QRMI. Pinagsasama ng SQD ang quantum sampling ng isang LUCJ ansatz na binuo gamit ang `ffsim` at self-consistent configuration recovery gamit ang `qiskit-addon-sqd`.\n"

